#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_WallysHouse/scripts.inc:68
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_WallysHouse_Text_ThanksForPlayingWithWally"
msgid ""
"You're…\n"
"Ah, you must be {PLAYER}{KUN}, right?\p"
"Thank you for playing with WALLY a\n"
"little while ago.\p"
"He's been frail and sickly ever\n"
"since he was a baby.\p"
"We've sent him to stay with my relatives\n"
"in VERDANTURF TOWN for a while.\p"
"The air is a lot cleaner there\n"
"than it is here.\p"
"What's that? Where's WALLY?\n"
"He's already left, our WALLY.\p"
"I wonder where he could have\n"
"gotten by now?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_WallysHouse/scripts.inc:84
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_WallysHouse_Text_WonderHowWallyIsDoing"
msgid "I wonder how our WALLY is doing?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_WallysHouse/scripts.inc:87
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_WallysHouse_Text_PleaseExcuseUs"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER}{KUN}! Please excuse us for\n"
"dragging you here this way.\p"
"But our WALLY's become very healthy\n"
"since he went to VERDANTURF TOWN.\p"
"We owe it all to you!\p"
"When WALLY left town, you helped\n"
"him catch a POKéMON, right?\p"
"I think that made WALLY really\n"
"happy.\p"
"Actually, not just WALLY.\n"
"It made me, his father, happy too.\p"
"Happy that he's gained such a great\n"
"friend as you.\p"
"This isn't a bribe or anything, but\n"
"I'd really like you to have this.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_WallysHouse/scripts.inc:104
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_WallysHouse_Text_SurfGoAllSortsOfPlaces"
msgid ""
"If your POKéMON can SURF, you'll be\n"
"able to go to all sorts of places.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_WallysHouse/scripts.inc:108
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_WallysHouse_Text_WallyIsComingHomeSoon"
msgid ""
"WALLY's coming home soon.\n"
"I'm looking forward to that.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_WallysHouse/scripts.inc:112
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_WallysHouse_Text_YouMetWallyInEverGrandeCity"
msgid ""
"Oh? You met WALLY in\n"
"EVER GRANDE CITY?\p"
"Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}, don't be silly.\p"
"He may have gotten healthy, but he\n"
"can't go somewhere far away like\l"
"that all by himself.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_WallysHouse/scripts.inc:120
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_WallysHouse_Text_WallyWasReallyHappy"
msgid ""
"WALLY was really happy when he told\n"
"us that he caught a POKéMON.\p"
"It's been ages since I've seen him\n"
"smile like that.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/PetalburgCity_WallysHouse/scripts.inc:126
msgctxt "PetalburgCity_WallysHouse_Text_WallyLeftWithoutTelling"
msgid ""
"I want you to keep this a secret\n"
"from my husband…\p"
"But our WALLY left VERDANTURF TOWN\n"
"without telling anyone.\p"
"You know, WALLY is frail, but\n"
"he's surprisingly strong-willed.\p"
"I'm sure that he'll come back safe\n"
"and sound one day!$"
msgstr ""
